msgctxt "136"
msgid "You still here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"I've asked a whole bunch of other people since I saw you last, but nobody "
"would give me the time of day..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Please... back me up on this! For my granny's sake!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Just be honest with her. Those lies of yours will never hold water."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"If your grandmother's that important to you, go back home and take care of "
"her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Okay... Thanks anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Okay. I suppose I'll take a supporting role in the performance of your "
"lifetime⑬for your grandmother's sake, you understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Oh, thank you so much! You don't know how much this'll help me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Come over this way. Granny's waiting."
msgstr ""

